Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.33,0:00:06.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Greetings!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.46,0:00:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Lastismoon and I currently handle
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,diplomatic relations here at the village.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.29,0:00:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please call me Lasty!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I am Flowrem.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.25,0:00:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let us show you around the village.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.00,0:00:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,The fields run from here to\Nthe far end you can see!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.92,0:00:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Much too expansive to show you around it all.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.83,0:00:29.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! Tomatoes here!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.67,0:00:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm Sena, and these are tomatoes!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Donovan, the Elder Dwarf.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.08,0:00:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We produce the alcohol.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Ya, the Mountain Elf.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.54,0:00:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're great at crafting things!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.92,0:01:09.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've done well to reach us.\NRest now at ease.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That seems a bit overboard.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.54,0:01:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But first impressions are key.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.58,0:01:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe for visitors from afar.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.46,0:01:18.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But this is for new residents.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.71,0:01:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,No need to be so stiff day after day.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.17,0:01:22.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suppose not.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.54,0:01:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice and friendly should do it, I think.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.92,0:01:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, how about some closing words?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, from me?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.08,0:01:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who else?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.88,0:01:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once again, then...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.83,0:01:39.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Mayor Hiraku.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.54,0:01:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Welcome to The Great Tree Village!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.21,0:03:28.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,The Story So Far
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to live\Na peaceful farming life.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.46,0:03:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,With some divine intervention,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.96,0:03:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got the farm life I wanted\Nin an alternate world.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.83,0:03:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've made so many new friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.38,0:03:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And now I'm the mayor of\NThe Great Tree Village,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.50,0:03:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,a place we all built together.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.00,0:03:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, the reason our little village...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.75,0:03:58.75,Q4,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,is a bit more active today...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.75,0:04:00.25,Q4,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.25,0:04:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,is a bit more active today...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to find places for them to live.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.79,0:04:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,So many people.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.88,0:04:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus the refugees.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.29,0:04:13.96,Q6,,0,0,0,,Over 100 New Residents
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.96,0:04:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,...is because we were expecting\Na great number of new residents.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.50,0:04:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,With that many, we might need\Na whole other village.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why not make one, then?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.92,0:04:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,A new village for all the new residents.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.00,0:04:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll scout out a new location!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.04,0:04:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder where's best.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.38,0:04:27.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And just like that...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.58,0:04:28.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time to chop down some trees!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.88,0:04:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,...the whole village set to work.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,...the whole village set to work.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.29,0:04:32.04,Q4,,0,0,0,,We need lots of preserved food.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.04,0:04:32.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,We need lots of preserved food.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.63,0:04:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The hunt begins then.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.58,0:04:38.38,Q7,,0,0,0,,Welcome to\NThe Great Tree Village
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.00,0:04:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We got so excited we even began practicing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.46,0:04:44.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Welcome to\NThe Great Tree Village
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.54,0:04:42.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need more smiles!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.04,0:04:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should relax things a bit?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are grapes!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! This is new.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.17,0:04:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Made with ingredients which spoil quickly
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.71,0:04:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,so that we might focus our efforts on\Nincreasing our supply of preserves.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.67,0:04:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That explains all the vegetables.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.17,0:04:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's treat the girls to the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good thinking.\NThis is perfect for eating on the job.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.38,0:05:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll bring it to them myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.67,0:05:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Flow did mention being extra busy.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.46,0:05:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is impossible...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.63,0:05:14.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.88,0:05:16.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,My ghost will haunt this place.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I brought you all some lunch.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're a little busy!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.38,0:05:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,A "little?"
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.33,0:05:24.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's nearly impossible to keep track\Nof food and material stores.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.83,0:05:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Having a lot is good though, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,A lot plus more equals a whole bunch...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.83,0:05:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That takes care of that!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.13,0:05:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What have you done?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.33,0:05:44.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Flow is bringing help, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.58,0:05:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.33,0:05:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Help from the Demonic Kingdom has arrived.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.96,0:05:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We were told we'd be aiding Lady Flowrem...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.46,0:05:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That it would advance our social standing...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.54,0:05:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That the work was simple enough\Nfor anyone to do...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.17,0:06:00.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get right to it, then!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.00,0:06:03.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll start by organizing\Nour records into categories.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.67,0:06:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about the all-you-can-eat apples?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.13,0:06:06.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the limitless pet-pets?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.63,0:06:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aren't you the daughter of House Puugal?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.67,0:06:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd heard you were missing\Nafter being attacked by lamia.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.29,0:06:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.50,0:06:14.04,Q4,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised to see you alive.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.25,Q4,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised to see you alive.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should be able to handle\Nall our paperwork now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.25,0:06:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should be able to handle\Nall our paperwork now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.29,0:06:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Share this with everyone\Nonce things settle down.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.88,0:06:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.92,0:06:42.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ve surveyed the area.\NI found no signs of danger.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.08,0:06:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I sent her out.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.13,0:06:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should go see the potential spot\Nfor the new village.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, great idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.17,0:06:54.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we make preparations?\NMeals for the road?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not that far off.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.17,0:06:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The location we're considering
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.67,0:07:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,will be downstream so that\Nwe might retain the upper hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The upper hand in what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.08,0:07:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,To ensure our safety\Nin the worst circumstances,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.63,0:07:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,it will be on the\Nfar side of the river.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.21,0:07:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It will also stand some distance\Nfrom the river itself
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.54,0:07:08.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,to ensure the village\Ndoes not seize control of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What worst circumstances?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.13,0:07:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rebellion.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're assuming\Nthat will happen?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.08,0:07:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We must at least be\Nprepared for as much.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It will be too late once it does.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.96,0:07:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fair point.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.13,0:07:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not quite as great as our own,\Nbut the area has its own standout tree.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.00,0:07:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Easy enough to spot.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.67,0:07:30.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once we had the location,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.29,0:07:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,we set about clearing the forest\Nto make a road.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.67,0:07:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.29,0:07:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.13,0:07:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup! Hah!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:37.33,0:07:38.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.46,0:07:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We lack the power.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.38,0:07:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's tougher than steel.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could you do your usual?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.75,0:07:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.92,0:07:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Axe!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.13,0:07:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wonton noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.63,0:07:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.13,0:07:57.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dandan noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.46,0:08:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Champon noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.79,0:08:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was easy work with\Nmy almighty farming tool.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.79,0:08:04.17,Q4,,0,0,0,,Noodles! Noodles! Noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.71,0:08:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We set up a wooden bridge across the river.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we build something sturdier?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.17,0:08:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we make it too big...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.17,0:08:14.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup! Hah!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.21,0:08:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,...large monsters might make use of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.50,0:08:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hadn't thought of that.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:19.67,0:08:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,After that...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.67,0:08:21.25,Q4,,0,0,0,,Noodles! Noodles! Noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.92,Q4,,0,0,0,,Noodles! Noodles! Noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We cleared out the area for the new village.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.92,0:08:23.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,And uhh... mapo noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.92,0:08:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We cleared out the area for the new village.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.67,Q4,,0,0,0,,And uhh... mapo noodles!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:26.50,0:08:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then built irrigation ducts.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.42,0:08:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Impressive progress in such a short time.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.50,0:08:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be able to get much done\Nwithout enough lumber.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.75,0:08:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please get some rest.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.33,0:08:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll handle the construction.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.38,0:08:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.38,0:08:58.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.13,0:09:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,A monument to Zabuton.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should have made it bigger.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.33,0:09:04.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was told you were resting.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am, sort of.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.13,0:09:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Papa sure loves work.\NOh yes, he does.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.42,0:09:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay okay, I'll take a break.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.17,0:09:22.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.21,0:09:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things are moving right along.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.96,0:09:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd wondered why you were\Npreparing so much lumber.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.42,0:09:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have plenty of houses to build, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got all the lumber our plans called for prepped.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.46,0:09:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,And had everyone else\Nbreak into teams to get them put up.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.67,0:09:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was hard work building things\Nfor myself back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.71,0:09:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't even have nails back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.21,0:09:47.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember that little shack? Good times.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I remember how hard it was\Nlifting all that wood.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.58,0:09:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.33,0:09:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't the right length.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.58,0:09:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That goes here.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.83,0:10:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, yes...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.42,0:10:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Magic sure is something.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.17,0:10:14.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.71,0:10:15.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.13,0:10:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need more boards, hm?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.08,0:10:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.88,0:10:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.63,0:10:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.25,0:10:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Surprisingly, yes...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Safety first.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.75,0:10:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,With everyone's help,\Nthings are really coming together.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.92,0:10:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,How many residents are we expecting?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.92,0:10:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We still don't really have concrete numbers.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.04,0:10:44.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.38,0:10:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive the intrusion.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.29,0:10:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have a message from Lord Dryme.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.21,0:10:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,He says he is bringing new residents now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.33,0:10:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do excuse the haste.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.54,0:11:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The situation was more pressing\Nthan anticipated.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.50,0:11:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You could have sent word.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.54,0:11:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm? I did just that.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.88,0:11:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I sent a messenger wyvern.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.79,0:11:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, but I may have outpaced it.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.67,0:11:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was in just that much a hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.54,0:11:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are the minotaurs\Nwho wish to move here.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.17,0:11:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,These are minotaurs?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.96,0:11:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I expected\Ncow-headed creatures.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.46,0:11:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Gordon, leader of our group.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the village mayor, Hiraku.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.21,0:11:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's huge.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.38,0:11:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well over two meters tall.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.58,0:11:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.46,0:11:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We were expelled from our village\Nand left wandering until we found help.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.71,0:11:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,They had children with them\Nand were in dire straits.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.46,0:11:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought that called for urgency.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.67,0:11:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Best not waste time on small talk.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.21,0:11:56.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get some food ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.04,0:11:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.46,0:11:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's our headcount?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seventy-two.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.54,0:12:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.46,0:12:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy yourselves.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.96,0:12:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rice porridge seemed\Nsafe enough to start with,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I wonder if there's\Nanything they can't eat.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.67,0:12:17.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,My apologies, I am unfamiliar\Nwith the ways of minotaurs.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.50,0:12:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Think anyone here knows more?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.83,0:12:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir, if I may.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:23.58,0:12:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.79,0:12:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I spent some time among minotaurs\Nin my last village.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.75,0:12:33.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Allow me to see what they need.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.08,0:12:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great. By all means.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.17,0:12:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you hail from the mountains?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.67,0:12:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've heard the winds are\Npleasant in summertime.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.50,0:12:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,They are.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.33,0:12:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's a big help.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.92,0:12:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should be all set with\Nthe housing we've set up.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.29,0:12:47.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I certainly hope so...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.17,0:12:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I missing something?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.17,0:12:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,These aren't the right size, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.46,0:12:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,They do seem a bit...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,cramped.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.42,0:12:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quite a bit.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.58,0:13:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This place is packed.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.33,0:13:07.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our guest quarters are just as full.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.79,0:13:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll need to think of something fast.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.50,0:13:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we save the new village\Nfor other newcomers...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.17,0:13:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've just received word from my father.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.58,0:13:18.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our new residents are en route now.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.88,0:13:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.33,0:13:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do forgive the abruptness.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.46,0:13:24.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.71,0:13:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Weren't you bringing war refugees\Nto find a new home?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.79,0:13:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things took a sudden turn, you see.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was forced to use teleportation\Nmagic in quick repetition
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.50,0:13:36.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,to move massive numbers to safety.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.00,0:13:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You really should consider your age, Father.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.25,0:13:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hearing you say that\Nonly makes me feel worse...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.25,0:13:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go on and rest, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.67,0:13:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Much obliged.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.92,0:13:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I suppose that means...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.25,0:13:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,our newest residents are\Nthese half-horse centaurs?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mind your eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.17,0:14:00.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Will you not introduce yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.88,0:14:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm Hiraku, mayor of this village.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.25,0:14:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am Gruwald of the centaurs.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.88,0:14:09.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Kin to Viscount Beeg's chief retainer.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.25,0:14:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess I should assume Viscount Beeg is\Nsome noble from the Demonic Kingdom?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.63,0:14:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why do you remain silent?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.50,0:14:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have been informed of my standing.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.42,0:14:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I expect you to take appropriate measures.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.33,0:14:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You expect us to wait further yet?!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.58,0:14:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do forgive us.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.00,0:14:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must tire from your journey.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.13,0:14:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Rest assured you stand now on land
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.50,0:14:36.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,with ties to Count Chrome.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Be at ease.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.17,0:14:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel bad, but I don't understand\Nthe rules of the nobility,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.63,0:14:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I leave all that to people who do.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.33,0:14:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Viscount Beeg?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.79,0:14:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's from out west, yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never made acquaintance.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.17,0:14:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Allow me, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.17,0:14:56.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We were sent word of your move,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.75,0:14:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,but you arrive at the most pressing of times.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.92,0:15:01.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make arrangements nonetheless.\NWe are beyond worn!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.75,0:15:05.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What brings you to us, Miss Gruwald?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:06.29,0:15:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I am not mistaken,\Nyou come seeking our aid.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.13,0:15:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,These lands are not yours\Nto take command of.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.21,0:15:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ask that you reconsider your assumptions.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.13,0:15:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You speak offense, village girl!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.71,0:15:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I'd yet to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.25,0:15:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am Lattiaci Drowa,\Ndaughter of Count Drowa.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.79,0:15:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Daughter of the Count?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.54,0:15:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Might I ask from whence you hail?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.33,0:15:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we ought to\Ndiscuss things elsewhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.83,0:15:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive my insolence!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.92,0:15:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.58,0:15:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ask you to pardon my actions as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.25,0:15:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I beg your forgiveness!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.38,0:15:56.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough, really!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.67,0:16:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Might I ask to be assigned to assist them?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.71,0:16:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,They do have ties to my family, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.67,0:16:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But is everything all right back home?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.46,0:16:12.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're in the middle of a war\Nbig enough to create refugees, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.83,0:16:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your concern is much appreciated.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.29,0:16:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been told there's nothing\Nto worry over right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's sure taking a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you get the feeling\Nshe won't be returning?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.88,0:16:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought she was here to help us...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:30.46,0:16:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,A complete mismatch yet again.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.58,0:16:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It would certainly be a tight fit.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.04,0:16:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you not grow smaller with magic?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.29,0:16:40.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hrmph! This is the best I can do.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.71,0:16:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not everyone is like you, Lu.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.33,0:16:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our largest buildings are full already.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.33,0:16:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll squeeze in.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.54,0:16:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,How many of you are there?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.21,0:16:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forty adults and sixty-four children\Nfor a total of one hundred and four.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.25,0:16:55.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yikes...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.08,0:16:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about the dungeon to the south?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.38,0:17:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The lamia might let them\Nstay a while if asked.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.38,0:17:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did we build this village for again?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't rub salt in the wound.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.17,0:17:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've got minotaurs and centaurs.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.33,0:17:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What other kind of taurs\Nshould we expect now?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.38,0:17:17.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,While I joked to myself, another group of\Nyoung women arrived at our gates.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.58,0:17:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The lamia found them\Nmoving through the woods.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:21.50,0:17:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They were trotting right through the forest,\Nso I thought I'd bring them here.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.67,0:17:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,They came on foot?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.25,0:17:30.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Through all the monsters and\Nother danger out there?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.67,0:17:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's with that stump?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.46,0:17:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it to sit on to rest?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.63,0:17:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, hi, I'm the mayor, Hiraku.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.25,0:17:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're not very talkative.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.75,0:17:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're nervous?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.29,0:17:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive us.\NWe aren't used to speaking.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.79,0:17:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can call me Igu.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.38,0:17:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for having us.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The stump can talk?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.29,0:17:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe that shouldn't be surprising.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.54,0:17:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Turns out these girls were nyunyu daphne.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.50,0:18:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wood spirits, of a sort.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.54,0:18:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,They had the ability to\Nturn themselves into plants
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.83,0:18:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,and took tree form whenever\Nthey encountered monsters.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,When damaged in tree form,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.38,0:18:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,they lose the ability to take\Nhumanoid form again for some time.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.04,0:18:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But why a stump?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.92,0:18:16.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,For easier transport.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.54,0:18:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Portable form, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.79,0:18:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our lands met with floods after humans\Ncut down most of the trees.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.38,0:18:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We crossed the Forest of Death\Nafter a merchant named Michael
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.29,0:18:29.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,told us of your village.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.83,0:18:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.21,0:18:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Michael probably couldn't tell us much\Nsince you traveled on your own.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.33,0:18:38.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry after all that walking.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.21,0:18:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should we host a feast?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.75,0:18:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feast or not, I'd like to\Nprepare you a meal.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you'd like?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.33,0:18:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We require no sort.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.71,0:18:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really, anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.83,0:18:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fruit.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We can easily get whatever fruit you'd like.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.96,0:18:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sir Michael showed us the fruit grown here.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.08,0:19:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you can grow such\Nincredible fruit on these lands...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.33,0:19:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Soil.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.33,0:19:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must have magnificent soil.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.50,0:19:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You feed on soil?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.92,0:19:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I showed them to an empty field\Nas requested but wasn't expecting...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,whatever this is.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.13,0:19:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's just as fragrant as I'd imagined.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.71,0:19:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We require no food.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.92,0:19:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only clean water, bright sun, and...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:29.50,0:19:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stopped mid-sentence.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.38,0:19:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,...magnificent soil.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.96,0:19:39.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe time moves differently\Nfor these wood spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.79,0:19:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.00,0:19:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've cleared all food-related matters,\Nbut what about housing?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.63,0:19:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Finally, new residents for all those houses!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.25,0:19:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have houses built and ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.79,0:19:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We require sunny outdoor spaces.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.79,0:19:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We could add bigger windows for more light.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.29,0:19:59.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,We prefer the outdoors.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.88,0:20:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not all the time, right?\NLike when it rains and such?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.38,0:20:04.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Out. Doors.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.75,0:20:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,For now, the young minotaurs\Nhave been given the houses,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:14.08,0:20:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,while the centaurs shared the stables.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.63,0:20:21.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The nyunyu daphne,\Nwell, they're still in the field.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Night.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.00,0:20:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll ever get used to the sight.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.67,0:20:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The other village is going to be\Nempty for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.29,0:20:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to work on getting places\Nfor all these folks for now.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.92,0:20:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things will be quite crowded until we do.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.92,0:20:45.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll need food, clothing,\Nand other necessities.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.29,0:20:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's start with what we can manage.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.04,0:20:48.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.92,0:20:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay, more work...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.17,0:20:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll need to design new homes.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.63,0:20:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course! Let's build nice big ones!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.21,0:21:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,For seventy-two minotaurs and\None hundred and four centaurs!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.92,0:21:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a ludicrous amount!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.08,0:21:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll make it work.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.63,0:22:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, Lady Gruwald.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.50,0:22:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I beg you forgive me for my discourtesy.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.50,0:22:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No need for apology.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.50,0:22:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you were only acting\Nin the best interest of your people.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.79,0:22:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I care not what becomes of me.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.13,0:23:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I want our children to be safe,\Nif you'll have them.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.75,0:23:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is up to the mayor, not me.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.83,0:23:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The man named Hiraku?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.75,0:23:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The mayor stands above all of us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.50,0:23:12.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Conversely, I fall near the bottom.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.71,0:23:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like a mere grain of sand.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.00,0:23:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But... You're the daughter of the count!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.54,0:23:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why do you imagine Count Chrome,\Nof the demon lord's four generals,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.63,0:23:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,ferried others here as if he were\Na mere workhorse?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.04,0:23:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope you understand how you should behave\Naround one who merits such action.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.63,0:23:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive my insolence!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.96,0:23:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.38,0:23:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really, though! Stand up, it's fine!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.17,0:23:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,An excellent apology.
